my life so hard","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B7M","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"But that's what gets me off","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B7M","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":22,"beat":1},{"symbol":"C#","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I had a thousand bad times","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"So what's another time to me? (What's that to me, yeah)","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"You try to burn my house down","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"But what's another house to me? (What's that to me, yeah)","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I can take anything that you give me (What you give me)","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"It's gonna take a lot more to kill me, bitch","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"So thank you for the grave (Yeah)","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"I needed me a place to sleep (Place to sleep)","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"And I don't wanna meet your mama (No)","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B7M","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"She prolly crazier than yo